<h2>Catechist's Guide</h2>
<p class="big-question">For class preparation and delivery. For the catechist's use only.</p>

<h3>Class Summary</h3>

<p><strong>Estimated duration:</strong> 60 minutes</p>
<p><strong>Central theme:</strong> God has placed in the human heart the desire for happiness. The beatitudes are the path that Jesus shows us to attain true beatitude.</p>
<p><strong>Objectives:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Understand that the desire for happiness comes from God and is satisfied only in him.</li>
  <li>Know the eight beatitudes of Mt 5:3-12.</li>
  <li>See the beatitudes as a path to holiness accessible to all.</li>
  <li>Discover eternal beatitude as the Christian's destiny.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Key verse:</strong> &laquo;Blessed are the poor in spirit, for theirs is the kingdom of heaven&raquo; (Mt 5:3)</p>
<p><strong>CCC references:</strong> 1716-1729</p>
</section>

